# Reports Directory

This directory contains generated reports from CI checks.

## Subdirectories

| Directory  | Description                    | Command                     |
|------------|--------------------------------|-----------------------------|
| coverage/  | Test coverage reports          | make test, make ci          |
| security/  | Bandit security scan reports   | make code-security, make ci |
| deptry/    | Dependency hygiene reports     | make code-deptry, make ci   |

## Top-level Files

| File           | Description      | Command         |
|----------------|------------------|-----------------|
| code-stats.txt | Code statistics  | make code-stats |

## Configuration

All report settings are in pyproject.toml:
- [tool.coverage.*]  - Coverage report paths and settings
- [tool.bandit]      - Security scan targets and severity
- [tool.deptry]      - Dependency check rules and ignores

All reports are gitignored except .gitkeep files.
